ould need to get hold of the pdf and have time to read it and time to talk to Chigg.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T06:04:31-08:00","id":5006,"title":"","content":"Also I hope everyone is happy with the show length and that we don't chop it up? While I know many Youtubers and other podcasts my be shorter, I think that would be a detriment to DD and how we interrelate CWoD and NWoD so that all segments have something to take away for all fans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T03:52:47-08:00","id":5795,"title":"","content":"Oh and if you are Google+ users we have a good community there for the podcast and from our G+ Page you can keep up to date with the podcast and blog <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/b/101605655207637258525/101605655207637258525/posts\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio G+</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T07:13:57-08:00","id":5885,"title":"","content":"Big fan of the podcast, just finished the last one. <br /> Some possible topics for future podcasts:<ul><li>Running WOD games online, tips for STs, Players, what are the best virtual game tables (Google + Hangouts, forums)</li> <li>WOD settings: how close to the real world is your world, do you reference contemporary figures? how much do you allow players to change history?</li> <li>Running WOD one-shots at conventions: tips, strategies for keeping the flow of the game, pregens vs players creating their characters?</li> </ul>Looking forward to the next one. Keep up the good work guys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T07:56:05-08:00","id":5916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JoeB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/438-darker-days-radio?p=5885#post5885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Big fan of the podcast, just finished the last one.<br /> Some possible topics for future podcasts:<ul><li>Running WOD games online, tips for STs, Players, what are the best virtual game tables (Google + Hangouts, forums)</li> <li>WOD settings: how close to the real world is your world, do you reference contemporary figures? how much do you allow players to change history?</li> <li>Running WOD one-shots at conventions: tips, strategies for keeping the flow of the game, pregens vs players creating their characters?</li> </ul>Looking forward to the next one. Keep up the good work guys.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are all quite apt, since we just ran a GMC rules Mortals one shot for the podcast, so we can sample it for examples of gameplay. Also as you know, I run WoD settings that use real world info a lot. And I have run enough one shots to have a feel for what 4 hours game play can hold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T03:16:16-08:00","id":11139,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">We will be having on the show Demon: the Descent developers </span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"color:#427FED\">+</span><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/101086749445633256761\" target=\"_blank\">Rose Bailey</a></span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"> and <span style=\"color:#427FED\">+</span><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/102250351067967934972\" target=\"_blank\">Matthew McFarland</a> so send us your questions to darkerdaysradio at gmail dot com, as we will be recording tomorrow!</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T19:39:33-08:00","id":11801,"title":"","content":"I love Darker Days Whenever a new show drops, I post a link in my forum game site to it. For a posible show/series have you guys thought about Antiquity? The Roman/Greeks/Egypt/Mesopotamia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1031-youvegotwildtalents","name":"youvegotwildtalents","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T00:56:35-08:00","id":14577,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/2013/11/20/darker-days-radio-53/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio #53</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Robo-Demons</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chris and Chigg are joined by the illustrious developers of <b>Demon: the Descent</b> - <b>Matt McFarland</b> and <b>Rose Bailey</b>! The hosts don't pull any punches as they explore the concepts of the newest Storytelling game. The nature of the Unchained is discussed, as well as their place in the New World of Darkness cosmology. Special attention is paid to the new Identity mechanic, and how it affects character backgrounds and ongoing stories. On the secret frequency, Chris takes us to the blasted reactors on Chernobyl, where a strange new fungus has emerged. Finally, the show closes with some discussion of <b>Blood &amp; Smoke</b> and the upcoming <b>Dark Eras</b> book.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Be sure to check us out at </span><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio</a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> or our Google Plus Community at </span><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220\" target=\"_blank\">https://plus.google.com/communities/...86985174488220</a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes! </span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LgPTjF0XkQI&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-code=\"LgPTjF0XkQI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/LgPTjF0XkQI/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></span></span></span><br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T19:31:38-08:00","id":16428,"title":"","content":"Dunno if you guys are still watching this topic, but a Changeling Centric Episode would be amazing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/863-doctor-lazarus","name":"Doctor Lazarus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T02:11:06-08:00","id":18306,"title":"","content":"We could do with more changeling content. Both for Dreaming and for Lost. But then usually these are best directed by actual questions listeners want addressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"