"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T11:13:14-07:00","id":195615,"title":"","content":"Darker Days Presents Darkling #35<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-presents-darkling-35/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/image-logo/286887/darkerdays_sq_1200x628.jpg?s=ef9d996b77a32657cc00ba35c6884454&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-presents-darkling-35/\" target=\"_blank\"> Darkling #35: Mage 20th Quickstart | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-presents-darkling-35/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-presents-darkling-35/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Executive Producer Mark Hope hits the airwaves once more to present a thorough review of the Mage: the Ascension 20th Anniversary Edition Quickstart Rules. Mark specifically discusses common pitfalls that new players and experienced storytellers may run into with these cursory rules, making this a necessary overview for all gamers. &nbsp; There are only a few days left for the Darker Days contest - email us what you think the new New World of Darkness game will be! &nbsp; Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Links for this episode: &nbsp; Mage 20 Kickstarter:&nbsp;https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-mage-the-ascension-20th-anniversary-edition Mage 20 FAQ:&nbsp;http://theonyxpath.com/mage-the-ascension-20th-anniversary-edition-faq-part-1/ </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Executive Producer Mark Hope hits the airwaves once more to present a thorough review of the </span></span><b>Mage: the Ascension 20th Anniversary Edition Quickstart Rules</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. Mark specifically discusses common pitfalls that new players and experienced storytellers may run into with these cursory rules, making this a necessary overview for all gamers.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T22:25:17-07:00","id":205710,"title":"","content":"Darker Days Radio Episode #58<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-58/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/image-logo/286887/darkerdays_sq_1200x628.jpg?s=ef9d996b77a32657cc00ba35c6884454&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-58/\" target=\"_blank\"> #58: Renegades of Irem | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-58/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-58/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Mike, Chris, and Chigg finish up Darker Days Season 5 with the traditional Wraith episode. This time they look at factions of Wraith - primarily The Hierarchy, Renegades, and Heretics. Next Chris presents a Secret Frequency on structures and ruins that predate known human civilizations. Finally, the three dig into Cursed Necropolis: DC, the first setting book for Mummy: the Cursed. &nbsp; Congratulations to the three winners of the most recent Darker Days contest. We'll be having the Classic World of Darkness themed segment in the future. &nbsp; Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Links for this episode: &nbsp; Midnight Express:&nbsp;http://midnightexpress.podbean.com/ Dave Brookshaw on Fallen World Chronicle:&nbsp;http://theonyxpath.com/addicted-to-mysteries/ Dark Ages Laibon:&nbsp;http://theonyxpath.com/v20-dark-ages-laibon/ </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Renegades of Irem</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mike, Chris, and Chigg finish up Darker Days Season 5 with the traditional Wraith episode. This time they look at factions of Wraith - primarily <b>The Hierarchy</b>, <b>Renegades</b>, and Heretics. Next Chris presents a Secret Frequency on structures and ruins that predate known human civilizations. Finally, the three dig into <b>Cursed Necropolis: DC</b>, the first setting book for Mummy: the Cursed.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Congratulations to the three winners of the most recent Darker Days contest. We'll be having the Classic World of Darkness themed segment in the future.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T12:10:07-07:00","id":256182,"title":"","content":"Darker Days Presents Gossip Ghouls #1<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog286887/DDlogoversion3copy_1200x628.jpg?s=9499c7891da27e0a17a99385a3bd120b&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> Darker Days Radio Presents Gossip Ghouls #1 | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Sam and Michelle head up a brand new Darker Days Darkling series, looking at horror in all forms and media, gaming, and gaming as women. Chris joins them to ask questions and to hit record.This episode looks at what made us weird, favourite horror films, and how we feel horror movies have evolved.Expect bad language, content of an adult nature, and irreverent humour.Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes! </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Sam and Michelle head up a brand new Darker Days Darkling series, looking at horror in all forms and media, gaming, and gaming as women. Chris joins them to ask questions and to hit record.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">This episode looks at what made us weird, favourite horror films, and how we feel horror movies have evolved.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Expect bad language, content of an adult nature, and irreverent humour.<br /> <br /> <br /> Darker Days Radio Episode #59<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/image-logo/286887/darkerdays_sq_1200x628.jpg?s=ef9d996b77a32657cc00ba35c6884454&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\"> #59: Skeletons in the Closet | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Season 6 begins where the epic Season 5 cliffhanger left off. Mike hangs from a chasm cliff with only his finger tips. Chris faces off against the 8th deathlord, Nagash. And Chigg stands in the underworld halls alone, his plasma pack blinking on empty.On this episode, the hosts reunite from their dangerous situations to discuss cool new World of Darkness books announced at GenCon. After that, Mike presents his skeleton from the closet, The Tremere Chronicle for Vampire: the Masquerade. The trio then delves into a secret frequency covering lost Russian cosmonauts. Finally, Chris presents his own skeleton, Momento Mori for Geist: the Sin-Eaters. &nbsp; Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Links for this episode: &nbsp; Midnight Express:&nbsp;http://midnightexpress.podbean.com/ Dave Brookshaw on Fallen World Chronicle:&nbsp;http://theonyxpath.com/addicted-to-mysteries/ Onyx Path 2015 Brochure:&nbsp;http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/133632/Onyx-Path-20142015-Publishing-Brochure </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\"><b>Skeletons in the Closet</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Season 6 begins where the epic Season 5 cliffhanger left off. Mike hangs from a chasm cliff with only his finger tips. Chris faces off against the 8th deathlord, Nagash. And Chigg stands in the underworld halls alone, his plasma pack blinking on empty.<br /> <br /> On this episode, the hosts reunite from their dangerous situations to discuss cool new World of Darkness books announced at GenCon. After that, Mike presents his skeleton from the closet, The Tremere Chronicle for <b>Vampire: the Masquerade</b>. The trio then delves into a secret frequency covering lost Russian cosmonauts. Finally, Chris presents his own skeleton, Momento Mori for <b>Geist: the Sin-Eaters</b>.</span></span><br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T16:59:50-07:00","id":257688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dr Ether</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/438-darker-days-radio?p=5003#post5003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">especially considering I wrote that huge Venice setting for CtL. I would need to get hold of the pdf and have time to read it and time to talk to Chigg.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was gold. I had four trips to Venice this year and I was highly inspired to run a chronicle there. I read your material and it was one of the best fan adaptations out there, like ever. I mean it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"