>Darker Days Radio Episode #68</a></b><br /><br /> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-68/\" target=\"_blank\">http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/dar...io-episode-68/</a><br /> <br /> Mike, Chris, and Matt discuss the latest news and interviews about White Wolf Publishing. Following a lengthy news update, Mike presents the classic Vampire: the Masquerade sourcebook Dark Colony covering the region of New England. Next, the crew explores a secret frequency on La Mancha Negra in Venezuela. Finally, Chris and Matt examine Heirs to Hell, a Demon: the Descent sourcebook about the offspring of the unchained.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-10T03:30:11-08:00","id":844993,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Next Weekend the DD Crew are interviewing a whole host of the team from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ByNightStudios/\" target=\"_blank\">By Night Studios</a> . We will be discussing a range of topics, including VtM and WtA LARP, BNS and their future plans, and of course, perhaps get a hint of what they have in store for the Grand Masquerade 2016.<br /> If you have questions for BNS, drop us a line here, on our G+ community, or at darkerdaysradio at gmail dot com</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Also, those who send in questions will be in for a chance of winning a copy of MET Vampire pdf. If you don't send a question in we will also on the show announce the other way to enter the draw.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T19:22:44-07:00","id":850929,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-69/\" target=\"_blank\">http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/dar...io-episode-69/</a><br /> Darker Days By Night<br /> <br /> Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by the luminaries of By Night Studios. CEO Jason the Elder, Lead Editor Jennifer &quot;Loopy,&quot; and Developer Jason the Younger walk listeners through the basics of Mind's Eye Theater live action role-play and highlight the differences between older editions and their new books. The guests dig deep into Mind's Eye Theater Vampire and Werewolf, presenting epic events from past LARPs and discussing their newest plans. In particular, By Night Studios is excited to present some of their plans for the upcoming Grand Masquerade 2016, September 1st-3rd in New Orleans!<br /> <br /> Check us out at <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio</a> or our Google Plus Community at <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220\" target=\"_blank\">https://plus.google.com/communities/...86985174488220</a>. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T06:29:10-07:00","id":858303,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-70/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio #70</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>End of Days, Darker Lines</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chris, and Matt are joined by Tia, artist and Nordic LARPer, who recently participated in the first of the new White Wolf Nordic LARPs, &quot;End of Line&quot;. She takes the time to give us some insight into Nordic LARP, and an overview of her experience in the End of Line event. <br /> For Tia's own excellent artwork, it can be found <a href=\