333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://static.wixstatic.com/media/974095_f71377465b084b8f9be1a13d53ac3059~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_700,h_2000,al_c,q_85/image.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Official Podcast Partner: Darker Days</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>World of Darkness Berlin</b>: We\u2019re happy to share that we\u2019ve joined forces with the awesome podcasters of Darker Days Radio, the Official Podcast Partner of the WoD Berlin convention! Darker Days will tape a live show in Berlin with exciting guests and report on the larps and other events.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">If you for some reason haven\u2019t come across the Darker Days podcast, <a href=\"http://worldofdarkness.berlin/so/9LZfEN9S/click?w=LS0tDQo1MWRjODM3MS02NjA4LTRmNDEtNjM1OC1iMjY2MTBmNTRhODYNCmh0dHA6Ly9wb2RjYXN0LmRhcmtlci1kYXlzLm9yZy8NCi0tLQ\" target=\"_blank\">check it out immediately</a>! It\u2019s friendly, smart and really knowledgeable about <b>White Wolf</b>\u2019s storyworld \u2013 just like all of you. You will love it!</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The World of Darkness Berlin crew will soon be on Darker Days to talk about what the convention is, our vision for the lamps and much more! To ask us questions for that show, please email Darker Days at <a href=\"http://worldofdarkness.berlin/so/9LZfEN9S/click?w=LS0tDQo1MWRjODM3MS02NjA4LTRmNDEtNjM1OC1iMjY2MTBmNTRhODYNCm1haWx0bzpkYXJrZXJkYXlzcmFkaW8mIzY0O2dtYWlsLmNvbQ0KLS0t\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"610500130a041305001812130005080e21060c00080d4f020e0c\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://static.wixstatic.com/media/974095_396b9f09df7d4e6ab0d85f1a0dd549bb~mv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_700,h_2000,al_c,q_85/image.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T20:46:06-08:00","id":1020155,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-74/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #74</a><br /> <b>World of Darkness: Berlin</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike and Chris are joined by Bjarke, Johanna, and Juhana - the organizers of the upcoming <b>World of Darkness: Berlin</b> fan festival. We discuss an array of subjects, from the premium live action events they are planning, as well as contests, workshops, and tabletop gaming action. Join us for this formative World of Darkness event on May 10-14, 2017.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">After the interview, Chris and Mike wrap up the holiday episode by discussing the dread Yule Cat of Iceland.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T19:44:58-08:00","id":1054600,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-75/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #75</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">February 25, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Pure Magic</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike, Chigg, and Matt tackle the World of Darkness and Chronicles of Darkness head on! The trio starts of with an in-depth analysis of <b>Dark Ages: Mage</b>, exploring perhaps the best magic system ever put out by White Wolf or Onyx Path. Then Mike presents the legendary cursed peak of Nyanga in Eastern Zimbabwe. Finally, Matt digs into <b>The Pure</b>, illustrating their strengths and weaknesses, and explaining how they might be used in Werewolf: the Forsaken 2nd edition.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Special thanks to <a href=\"https://occamslaser.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Occam's Laser</a> for providing new music for our intro, outro, and bumpers.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Note:</b> This episode was recorded prior to the latest actions by White Wolf Publishing. Our thoughts on that matter will be presented in an upcoming episode.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-01T12:15:40-07:00","id":1071778,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-76/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #76</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 31, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Video Games</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike and Pete take a look at all of the World of Darkness video games, from <b>Vampire: the Masquerade - Redemption</b> to <b>Mage: the Ascension: Refuge</b>. There are some big announcements this episode, so stay tuned.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T15:42:56-07:00","id":1090503,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-77/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #77</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">April 30, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Demons Conquering Love</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike, Chris, Chigg, and Matt strive through an epic four segment show, bringing you news, reviews, and even a little insight. First, Mike and Chigg explore the concept of <b>Love Beyond Death</b>. Then Chris reviews the <b>Demon Storyteller's Guide</b> for Demon: the Descent. Mike also presents the Bunyip in a very special secret frequency. And finally, Matt dares the unknown to bring us the penultimate analysis of <b>Night Horrors: Conquring Heroes</b>.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T18:18:47-07:00","id":1092176,"title":"","content":"Didn't you guys make a big deal about how you weren't going to bother reviewing any more Beast material? That you guys were (and advocating for listeners) to vote with their wallets with what you felt was a bad product, did not want to reward OPP for putting it out, and that at best you guys would only bother to look at the free Stretch Goals/Backer Rewards?<br /> <br /> Because Conquering Heroes was not a Stretch Goal/Backer reward. It was a normal CofD book that you had to pay for to get the initial Advance PDF, or the final release.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-14T01:06:43-07:00","id":1092266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/438-darker-days-radio?p=1092176#post1092176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didn't you guys make a big deal about how you weren't going to bother reviewing any more Beast material? That you guys were (and advocating for listeners) to vote with their wallets with what you felt was a bad product, did not want to reward OPP for putting it out, and that at best you guys would only bother to look at the free Stretch Goals/Backer Rewards?<br /> <br /> Because Conquering Heroes was not a Stretch Goal/Backer reward. It was a normal CofD book that you had to pay for to get the initial Advance PDF, or the final release.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> True. Which is why we used our DTRPG affiliate credit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-14T01:13:48-07:00","id":1092268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/438-darker-days-radio?p=1092176#post1092176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because Conquering Heroes was not a Stretch Goal/Backer reward. It was a normal CofD book that you had to pay for to get the initial Advance PDF, or the final release.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hi, thanks for the feedback.<br /> <br /> At this time I would not expect Beast to appear again on Darker Days Radio until a suitably impressive book is released. We don't like giving negative reviews when we don't have to and I expect many people do not like listening to them. We have said what we have to about Beast and I think everyone would be happy if we left that game line alone. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a 