9\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May 27, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>World of Darkness: Ukraine</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike is joined by Natali, Vladimir, and Anton to discuss World of Darkness gaming in Ukraine and beyond. The crew explores their own fan community on VK, swap stories about why they like White Wolf games, and recommend a few of their favorite books.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T19:43:48-07:00","id":1099721,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-79/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #79</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">June 3, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Creating Chronicles for your Worlds of Darkness</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike and Chris have recorded their World of Darkness Berlin lecture on translating cool concepts from the Chronicles of Darkness settings to the World of Darkness. In particular they discuss <b>Vampire</b>, <b>Werewolf</b>, and <b>Mage</b>, but a little <b>Wraith</b> and the <b>God Machine</b> leak in as well.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T19:48:01-07:00","id":1102175,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/80-enlightenment-in-blood-war-stories/\" target=\"_blank\">#80: Enlightenment in Blood War Stories</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">June 10, 2017</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Chris has been hard at work, piecing together the narrative of World of Darkness: Berlin's Enlightenment in Blood LARP through a series of interviews. First, we discover the machinations of Brendon's Tremere rebels. Then, we get's the full story of Integral Solutions Inc. through Tim's Glass Walker Theurge. And then finally, we unveil the true source of that evening's chaos - Ian and his Redcap buddies. It's a compeling tale and our final World of Darkness Berlin coverage. Enjoy!</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Special thanks to <a href=\"https://occamslaser.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Occam's Laser</a> for providing new music for our intro, outro, and bumpers.</span> <br /> <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Be sure to check us out on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a> or through our <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220\" target=\"_blank\">Google Plus Community</a>. To stay up to date, subscribe through <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/darker-days-podcast/id317126542?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\">iTunes</a>! </span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T05:27:49-07:00","id":1108357,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-presents-darkling-42-deviant-activities/\" target=\"_blank\">Darkling #42: Deviant Activities</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">June 27, 2