ioned topics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T19:40:15-07:00","id":1197841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/438-darker-days-radio?p=1165041#post1165041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any time stamps for the different topics? Don't feel like jumping back and forth through a 50 minute podcast when I'm only interested in a few of the mentioned topics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hi Tessie, we can talk about adding those to future episodes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T19:47:21-07:00","id":1197845,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/84-the-suppressed-transmission-part-2/\" target=\"_blank\">#84: The Suppressed Transmission, Part 2</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 21, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Despite high power government jamming, reducing audio quality to one quarter, Mike and Chigg start up the Secret Frequency once more. They diseminate critical storyteller information about pirate radio stations, historical cases of broadcast signal intrusion, and finally, the Toynbee Tiles. Stay tuned for Part 1, coming soon.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Do not adjust your podcatcher. We control the vertical, and the horizontal. And The Messengers definitely aren't angels.</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T09:43:49-07:00","id":1201944,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/85-the-suppressed-transmission-part-1/\" target=\"_blank\">#85: The Suppressed Transmission, Part 1</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">April 1, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">What is this, some sort of joke? Mike and Chigg present a humorous episode on H.P. Lovecraft and the Cthulhu Mythos, exploring four of his short stories in an extra long secret frequency. This episode also includes some super out-dated news from 2017, blasphemous rumors, and a compelling analysis of Boston game stores.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Time Stamps:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">6:20 - News<br /> 16:30 - Secret Frequency</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T06:53:40-07:00","id":1213775,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/86-hunter-vs-hunter/\" target=\"_blank\">#86: Hunter vs. Hunter</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May 1, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Mike and Chris sit back to explore... Beast: the Primordial?! That's right, the show begins with a positive review of the final two chapters of the <b>Beast Players Guide</b>, and then dives into other news, like the V5 preorders, return of <b>Vampire: the Eternal Struggle </b>to print, and upcoming <b>Cyberpunk</b> Live Action events. In the World of Darkness segment, Mike discusses Wraith's Risen as portrayed in <b>Hunter: the Walking Dead</b>. Chris then presents an enthralling secret frequency on poltergeist activity in his local Yorkshire. Finally, the duo listen to an insightful introduction to <b>Hunter: the Vigil</b>, provided by game author Alex Greene.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Time Stamps:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">00:07:19 - News<br /> 00:38:26 - Contest<br /> 00:41:19 - Risen in Hunter<br /> 01:07:15 - Secret Frequency<br /> 01:19:04 - Hunter: the Vigil Rapid Fire</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Jackelope Live Action Studios Contest</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Win a free ticket** to The Night in Question Vampire: the Masquerade Sabbat LARP in Austin, Texas, Saturday November 17th, 2018! Just find Mike and Chris LARPing in the embedded World of Darkness Berlin trailer and submit the time stamp, a description, or a humorous guess to<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4226233029273026233b313023262b2d02252f232b2e6c212d2f\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"89ede8fbe2ecfbede8f0fafbe8ede0e6c9eee4e8e0e5a7eae6e4\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> by May 31st, 2018!</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T13:08:33-07:00","id":1213870,"title":"","content":"As far as I know, there was only one developer on all chapters of the BPG, throughout the writing process (I know because I worked on it). Unless there was some behind the scenes stuff in the later stages, but I also didn\u2019t notice any massive changes between drafts and the final. Just FYI! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 05-01-2018, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-23T19:41:48-07:00","id":1221597,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darkling-47-gamma-world-actual-play/\" target=\"_blank\">Darkling #47: Gamma World Actual Play</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May 24, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">After Mike and Chigg have a stressful week, Matt offers to run a game of <b>Gamma World 7th Edition: 4th Edition</b>. Get ready for a spooky actual play adventure starring the curious Igneous George and the enigmatic Man in Yellow...</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-03T16:26:41-07:00","id":1224474,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darkling-48-onyx-path-at-ukge-2018/\" target=\"_blank\">Darkling #48 Onyx Path at UKGE 2018</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">June 4, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Chris speaks to Matt McElroy of Onyx Path publishing to talk about UKGE, and all the products and games that are coming out, Kickstarters, and future events that OPP want to attend.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Apologies for the popping in the audio - lost the windshield for the mic, and no press area this year, so I was not sure how close to the mic I needed to be.</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T18:37:07-07:00","id":1227799,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/88-full-metal-rpg-horror/\" target=\"_blank\">#88: Full Metal RPG Horror</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">June 16, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">From the darkest, grimiest corners of urban myth come Brendan Carrion and Adam Sink of the <b>Full Metal RPG</b> Podcast! These two master storytellers join Mike and Chris to show listeners how to amp up their games, double down on terror, and accidentally mix<b>My Little Pony</b> with <b>Hellraiser</b>. Combined with some hot takes on Vampire 5th Edition and a secret frequency on the real life Fall River Satanic Cult, this is a must listen episode!</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Remember to check out the Full Metal RPG <a href=\"http://fullmetalrpg.com/product-category/zines/\" target=\"_blank\">Horrorism and Survivalism 'zines</a>, a great resource for storyteller ideas.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Time Stamps:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">00:06:30 - World of Darkness News </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">00:31:10 - Who Is Full Metal RPG?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">00:52:25 - What Is Survivalism and Horrorism?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">01:18:20 - The Secret Frequency</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:57:08-07:00","id":1238467,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/89-death-is-not-the-end/\" target=\"_blank\">#89: Death Is Not The End</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">July 24, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">From a tomb beneath the frozen wastelands of Sweden, Karim Muammar and Matthew Dawkins of <a href=\"http://www.white-wolf.com/\" target=\"_blank\">White Wolf Entertainment</a> join Mike and Chris to give an overview of <a href=\"https://www.modiphius.net/collections/vampire-the-masquerade\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire the Masquerade 5th edition</a> (still available for preorder from Modiphius).</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Karim is the chief editor, and has developed the new systems that are in the undead heart of V5.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Matthew Dawkins (recently announced as Senior Community Director for White Wolf) is one of the writers on V5, following up his work with <b>Onyx Path Publishing</b> on Beckett's Jyhad Diary.</span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T06:15:44-07:00","id":1238887,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/90-ascension-night-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-actual-play/\" target=\"_blank\">#90: Ascension Night (Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition Actual Play)</a></b><br /><br /> July 26, 2018<br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">London is burning and they're on the run. Destitute, low on blood, and out of gas, four kindred escape the Second Inquisition only to find themselves shunned by the cloistered Camarilla of Manchester. But after their new haven is burned down by a rival coterie, these neonates show the city that they messed with the <i>wrong</i> bloodsuckers.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Join the full cast of Darker Days Radio for the very first live play of <b>Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition</b>! We explore Manchester by Night, explain and demonstrate the finalized rules of <b>V5</b>, and, if luck would have it, escape our Ascension Night alive.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T17:45:30-07:00","id":1242548,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/gencon-2018-introducing-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/\" target=\"_blank\">Gencon 2018: Introducing Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 4, 2018</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Changeling renegade Chigg brings listeners another clandestine Gencon recording, as White Wolf hosts a panel introducing <b>Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition</b>! White Wolf brings in a host of authors to discuss the development process, tantalize fans about future releases, and illustrate their path forward in the world of darkness and the world of licensing.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T18:19:35-08:00","id":1280227,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/96-chicago-by-night-with-crystal-mazur/\" target=\"_blank\">#96: Chicago by Night with Crystal Mazur</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">January 12, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Live from PAX Unplugged, Mike is joined by Onyx Path writer<b>Crystal Mazur</b>! The two discuss the growth of PAX, the dynamism of Onyx Path, Crystal's street cred, and her first work for Onyx Path Publishing - the upcoming <b>Chicago by Night 5th Edition</b>!</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Be sure to check us out on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a> or through <b>our brand new Discord server <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GGuRKAn\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/GGuRKAn</a></b>. To stay up to date, subscribe through <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/darker-days-podcast/id317126542?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\">iTunes</a>! </span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T17:55:02-08:00","id":1281596,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/96-the-annual-dragonmeet-coffee-bar-special/\" target=\"_blank\">#97: The Annual Dragonmeet Coffee Bar Special</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">January 18, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Chris was at Dragonmeet 2018, in London last December, a day after getting back from Boston, and he sat down with <b>Onyx Path Publishing </b>freelancers and developers <b>David Brookshaw </b>and <b>Christopher Allen</b>. They chat all about the releases coming up, plus some more exclusive information for <b>Mummy: the Curse 2nd Edition</b> and <b>Deviant: the Renegades</b>.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-25T11:04:09-08:00","id":1282682,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/98-shadows-of-steel-city/\" target=\"_blank\">#98: Shadows of Steel City</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">January 25, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mike is roaming the isles of the UK, and arrives in Sheffield, &quot;Steel City&quot;, and so meets up with Chris and James for this episode.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://scontent-lht6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/50567131_10155671230226076_736744044117360640_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-lht6-1.xx&amp;oh=374f3260082fc9f9f05d4d2d01f8a62a&amp;oe=5CFFCF29\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">We discuss recent White Wolf and Onyx Path Publishing news, plus chat about gaming, before delving into some Sheffield inspired Secret Frequency material</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T20:17:19-08:00","id":1288823,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/100-kindred-of-the-east-rpg-setting/\" target=\"_blank\">#100: Kindred of the East RPG Setting</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">February 16, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Join the Darker Days team for Episode #100! Mike, Chris, and Chigg tackle the most hotly demanded book from the past 99 episodes...<b>Kindred of the East</b>! The team focuses solely on Kindred of the East's Middle Kingdom setting, exploring the monstrous creation of the Second Breath, the stabilizing nature of the Dharmic Paths, and ponder what the intended game structure is supposed to be. Get ready for some crossover discussion, with a lot of ideas thrown around for Vampire, Mage, Wraith, and Mummy.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Darker Days is testing out a new format, and next week's episode will include a detailed Kindred of the East character creation. Please let us know what you think of the new format.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-22T17:25:32-08:00","id":1290937,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/101-kindred-of-the-east-character-creation-and-hot-takes/\" target=\"_blank\">#101: Kindred of the East Character Creation and Hot Takes</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">February 22, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Following the exploration of <b>Kindred of the East</b>'s setting last week, Mike, Chris, and Chigg create a Kuei-Jin player character, Mapuana, and discuss the character creation process and rules for this sourcebook. Spoiler Alert: Chris and Chigg like the game better after learning the rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Darker Days is testing out a new format, please let us know what you think!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-08T20:04:41-08:00","id":1295194,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/102-cyberpunk-2020-2077-red-rpg-setting-special-guest-matt-webb/\" target=\"_blank\">#102: Cyberpunk 2020 / 2077 / Red RPG Setting (Special Guest Matt Webb)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 1, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by LARP luminary Matt Webb to explore the setting basics of <b>Cyberpunk 2020</b>. This classic roleplaying game codifies the character roles of game structure of cyberpunk gaming decades later, and holds up as an entertaining and challenging roleplaying experience. The team discusses the setting's style, Night City, corporations, and edgerunner characters, while teasing future episodes on the Jackelope <b>Cyberpunk: Night City LARP</b> and a review of <b>World of Future Darkness</b>.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T07:09:00-07:00","id":1297240,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/103-cyberpunk-night-city-larp-special-guest-matt-webb/\" target=\"_blank\">#103: Cyberpunk Night City LARP (Special Guest Matt Webb)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 8, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by Matt Webb of Jackalope Live Action Studios to discuss the upcoming <b>Cyberpunk: Night City LARP</b>! Matt explains the vision for the live action game, the unique venue they've chosen, and the incredible rules and set design that will make Cyberpunk come alive.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Cyberpunk: Night City</b> will take place May 24-25, 2019 in San Antonio, Texas and on The Net. Be sure to grab your tickets for this unique event at: <a href=\"http://cyberpunk.jackalope-larp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://cyberpunk.jackalope-larp.com/ </a></span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T10:34:47-07:00","id":1299266,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/104-skinwalker-ranch-a-secret-frequency/\" target=\"_blank\">#104: Skinwalker Ranch, A Secret Frequency</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 22, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike takes listeners on a journey to <b>Skinwalker Ranch</b>, a real world location of urban myth that may inspire your horror games.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T15:15:48-07:00","id":1302657,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/105-nightlife-rpg-review-an-april-fools-horror-heartbreaker/\" target=\"_blank\">#105: Nightlife RPG Review (An April Fools Horror Heartbreaker)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">April 1, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">What begins as a simple, farcical April Fool's review ends with Chigg and Mike failing some Sanity checks, losing Maximum Humanity, and facing their own Hubris. Get ready for <b>Nightlife</b>, an Urban Horror Role-playing Game published at some undisclosed time in the Nineteen Nineties...</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This episode was inspired by the System Mastery podcast, whose host Jef recently wound up in a U.S. hospital without insurance (he gave his insurance to his baby daughter instead). Please consider helping him with the exorbitant medical bills: <b><a href=\"http://bit.ly/livingmastery\" target=\"_blank\">Bit.ly/livingmastery</a></b></span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-20T08:21:33-07:00","id":1306254,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/106-world-of-future-darkness-and-bleeding-edge-setting-reviews/\" target=\"_blank\">#106: World of Future Darkness and Bleeding Edge Setting Reviews</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">April 12, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike calls Pete, a resident of the future, and gets ready to discuss the numerous articles and ebooks covering <b>Cyberpunk</b>, the World of Darkness, and Chronicles of Darkness. First up is <b>World of Future Darkness</b>, an article in White Wolf Magazine #36, giving you rules and setting advice to crossover Cyberpunk 2020 and Vampire: the Masquerade. Then they cover <b>Mirrors: Bleeding Edge</b>, a generic cyberpunk ebook for Chronicles of Darkness.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-17T15:00:50-07:00","id":1312827,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/107-geist-the-sin-eaters-rpg-setting-review/\" target=\"_blank\">#107: Geist: the Sin-Eaters RPG Setting</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May 10, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike, Chris, Chigg, and Matt sit down to discuss Geist: the Sin-Eaters 2nd Edition. It is a game where your character has died and come back, making a pact with a powerful ghostly being in order to return to the realm of the living. This episode focuses on the setting of Geist, introducing the new stories you can tell and the supernatural realms to be explored in this storytelling game of second chances.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Darker Days will have a 10th anniversary <a href=\"https://www.ukgamesexpo.co.uk/game.php?id=SEM5242\" target=\"_blank\">live show at UK Games Expo!</a> Be sure to check it out with special guests from Onyx Path, Modiphius, and White Wolf Entertainment.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-17T15:02:22-07:00","id":1312829,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/108-geist-the-sin-eaters-character-creation-and-hot-takes/\" target=\"_blank\">#108: Geist the Sin Eaters Character Creation and Hot Takes</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May 17, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike, Chris, Chigg, and Matt<a href=\"https://darkerdaysradio.wordpress.com/2019/05/17/geist-the-sin-eaters-character-creation-sample-character/\" target=\"_blank\"> create a character for Geist: the Sin Eaters 2nd Edition</a> and discuss the new rules. Does the mechanics live up to the setting hype </span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Darker Days will have a 10th anniversary <a href=\"https://www.ukgamesexpo.co.uk/game.php?id=SEM5242\" target=\"_blank\">live show at UK Games Expo!</a> Be sure to check it out with special guests from Onyx Path, Modiphius, and White Wolf Entertainment.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-17T15:04:21-07:00","id":1312831,"title