> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Onyx Path was gracious enough to let us record and release their panel. Please also consider following their new <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch channel</a>!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:01:05 - What's Up with Onyx Path?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T14:37:55-07:00","id":1330134,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/117-vampire-5th-edition-warcry-and-gw-ex-staffer-chat-live-from-fanboy-3-gencon-pop-up-2019/\" target=\"_blank\">#117: Vampire 5th Edition, Warcry, and GW Ex-Staffer Chat (Live from Fanboy 3 Gencon Pop-up 2019)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 6, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fueled only by beer and curry, Chris is joined by David Whitworth of the <a href=\"https://darkerdaysradio.wordpress.com/2019/07/02/shadows-and-skirmish/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Blog</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/RisingSunPaintingStudio/about/\" target=\"_blank\">Rising Sun Painting Studio</a>. They discuss their <b>Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition</b> demos using the upcoming <b>Ahriman Contract</b> scenario, the brand new Warhammer <b>Warcry</b> skirmish game, <b>Kult</b>, <b>Kingdom Death</b>, and upcoming UK conventions. Then the electronic base beat starts and things get interesting as these two former Games Workshop: Manchester employees start swapping war stories from the good 'ole days...</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:00:33 - Gencon Pop-Up Discussion<br /> 00:22:40 - GW Ex-Staffers Talk About Old Times</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-10T18:29:14-07:00","id":1330332,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/118-chiggs-gencon-2019-roundup-live-from-his-kitchen-table/\" target=\"_blank\">#118: Chigg\u2019s Gencon 2019 Roundup (Live From His Kitchen Table)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 9, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Surviving his arduous journey back to the Lone Star State, Chigg regales Mike and the listeners with stories of his Gencon experience. He recounts tales of <b>Star Trek</b>technobabble, the dangers of chocolate in <b>Pugmire</b>, gives warnings of collectible card game addiction, and tantalizes with the possibility of running <b>Cyberpunk Red</b>. </span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This episode is a bit light on the horror roleplaying content, but we'll be back to our regularly scheduled shows in two weeks!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:00:33 - Gencon Roundup!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T13:25:04-08:00","id":1348722,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/125-gehenna-gaming-the-world-of-darkness-multi-game-collective/\" target=\"_blank\">#125: Gehenna Gaming, The World of Darkness Multi-Game Collective</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">November 15, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike and Chris are joined by Ian of <b>Gehenna Gaming</b>, a rad gaming collective using interlinked tabletop chronicles of <b>Vampire: the Masquerade</b> to tell complex stories and also introduce new players to the game. Ian discusses the group's current New England based chronicles, their plans to explore <b>Kult</b> and <b>Call of Cthulhu</b>, and finally some spicy plans for the future.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gehenna Gaming and Mike of Darker Days will be running 4 tables of Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition games at <b>PAX Unplugged</b> - December 6th-8th in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. Come by and join us!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-01T17:39:28-08:00","id":1352081,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/127-mummy-the-curse-2nd-edition-rpg-setting-first-impressions/\" target=\"_blank\">#127: Mummy: the Curse 2nd Edition. RPG Setting First Impressions</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">December 1, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crystal, Chigg, and Mike discuss the new <b>Mummy: the Curse 2nd Edition</b>, looking at the preview documents for the ongoing kickstarter. They discuss how the new edition tackles niggling issues from the previous edition, how rad the &quot;achronological time&quot; idea is, updates to the rules and setting, and how this edition of Mummy may actually be the best Chronicles of Darkness game for new players. </span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Spoiler Alert: Chigg wants to play <i>and</i> run this game.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike and Crystal will be at PAX Unplugged, December 6th - 8th in Philadelphia, PA. Stop by and say hi or play in one of our games!</span></span></span></sp